00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:11.920
The scene takes place in the first half of the&nbsp;
Sabaody Archipelago Arc that until today is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:18.720
one of my favourite Arcs overall. The Mermaid&nbsp;
Camie has been kidnapped by human traffickers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:24.400
to be sold at a salve auction, and the straw hats&nbsp;
have entered the auction hall planning to use the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:30.480
200 million berry of treasure they have to buy&nbsp;
her free without causing any major commotion.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:36.320
Next to the general high society of the One&nbsp;
Piece world, dressed in glamorous cloths,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:42.880
three celestial dragons have joined the auction&nbsp;
as well, and so have Eustas Kid and Trafalgar Law.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:48.800
Before their eyes a young dancing girl&nbsp;
is being sold for 7.2 Million Berry.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:55.600
Meanwhile, a very frustrated&nbsp;Charlos, who wants to&nbsp;
buy a mermaid to be chased around in his piranha&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.240 --> 00:03:08.000
tank,&nbsp;kicks another of his slaves. The next&nbsp;
candidate is a former renowned pirate captain,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:14.240
that is now being sold off like cattle. Before&nbsp;
anyone in the audience can start bidding however,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:20.480
his mouth starts filling with blood and he&nbsp;
collapses on the floor. As it turns out he has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:28.720
bitten off his tongue to kill himself rather&nbsp;
than become a slave. Next up is finally Camie,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:34.240
who like all other slaves wears a collar that&nbsp;
will explode should anyone try to remove it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:43.120
The crew seems confident to get her, however upon&nbsp;
seeing the mermaid, Charles immediately bids 500 M&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:49.680
Berries and seals the deal for her to the shock&nbsp;
of everyone else in the room. The now terrified&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:55.360
Camie tries to scream out to&nbsp;Hatchan, but her&nbsp;
cries can’t reach though the walls of her tank.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.640 --> 00:04:02.800
When Kid decides to leave upon seeing all this,&nbsp;
Luffy and Zoro finally reach the hall as well&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:11.360
in their typical fashion, by smashing through the&nbsp;
roof. Upon seeing Camie Luffy starts towards her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:17.520
tank, but is stopped by Hacchan, who accidentally&nbsp;
reveals all of his arms and thus him being a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:23.440
fishman. This immediately creates panic within&nbsp;
the auction hall as the fishmen are not only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:29.200
strongly discriminated against here, but actually&nbsp;
banned from even setting foot on the island.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:41.280
And so for the very first time the crew gets&nbsp;
to witness the true level of discrimination&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:46.880
against their race first hand. The turmoil&nbsp;
stops as suddenly as it has started when the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:53.840
room is suddenly pirced by gun fire. As Luffy&nbsp;
turns around, he sees Hacchan falling over,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.840 --> 00:05:00.240
shot by none other than the Celestial Dragon&nbsp;
Charlos, who is excitedly celebrating his kill.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:08.400
In this moment Luffy’s entire demeanour changes.&nbsp;
While the onlookers are relieved that the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:15.680
dangerous and disease-riddled monster has been&nbsp;
killed, he starts walking towards the Tenryubito.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:20.560
The heavily wounded Hacchan tries to stop&nbsp;
him, blaming himself for what happened&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:25.440
and apologising that he could not make up&nbsp;
for what he had done to Nami and her village,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:32.640
fully redeeming his character. This however&nbsp;
just seems to harden Luffy’s resolve.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.280 --> 00:05:40.480
Unstoppable he closes in on Charlos, who fails&nbsp;
to shoot him, and Luffy punches him in the face&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:44.720
so hard, that he leaves a permanent&nbsp;
imprint of his fist on his face.&nbsp;

